Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='generalmechanism', at=datetime(2026, 10, 20, 0, 0, 0), actor='owner', title='Write the general mechanism: simplify by generality, never by dropping a capability', body='Before adding a store, verb, route, card, reading or wire type, find the existing ones of its kind. When a new piece would be another copy of their shape, make one generic piece and express both through it. When two things turn out to be instances of one, move the code toward that structure, in the same change if it is small or as the next named stage. A special case becomes data or configuration. Removing a capability is never a simplification.', rationale='Copies drift apart and each later bug is fixed in one of them; a general piece with laws is fixed once.', supersedes=()))